  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Unroll phyllo pastry and cut into 4 equal pieces.",
    "In a large bowl, mix feta cheese, kefalograviera cheese, hot chilli powder, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush olive oil on the phyllo pieces and place a cheeseful on each piece.",
    "Roll up each piece and place seam-side down in a baking dish.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes or until golden brown and crispy.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley before serving."
